  "extraction_notes": "[text-pass] The paper focuses on the phonon properties and nanostructure of AgSbTe2-family compounds. While it mentions zT values (zT ~ 1.3 at 720 K for pure AgSbTe2 and zT > 2 for LAST alloys) in the body text, these are cited from other literature (refs 15-17) rather than being experimental results from the current study. The only explicit thermoelectric property data extracted from the study's own measurements is the calculated lattice thermal conductivity contribution of phonon branches in Table 1. [figure-pass p1-5] The provided pages focus on phonon scattering and lattice thermal conductivity of AgSbTe2-family compounds. Thermoelectric property data (Seebeck, electrical conductivity, power factor, ZT) as a function of temperature were not found in the provided figures or tables. Lattice thermal conductivity data for Ag0.8Sb1.2Te2.2 was extracted from Figure 4b. [figure-pass p6-7] The provided pages contain a list of references and acknowledgements related to AgSbTe2 and other thermoelectric materials, but they do not contain any plots or tables showing thermoelectric properties (Seebeck coefficient, electrical conductivity, thermal conductivity, lattice thermal conductivity, power factor, or ZT) as a function of temperature for any AgSbTe2-family compounds. ",
